OL,3,ARape and sex offence specialists on all
OL,4,Apolice forces by 2027, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FInvestigators specialising in rape and
OL,7,Fsex offences will be introduced to
OL,8,Fevery police force in England and Wales
OL,9,Fby the end of 2027, the government has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FMinisters are speeding up the rollout
OL,13,Fof the scheme, previously announced by
OL,14,FSir Keir Starmer's government, by 18
OL,15,Fmonths as part of efforts to tackle
OL,16,Fviolence against women and girls
OL,17,F(VAWG).
OL,19,FThey are also offering more money for
OL,20,Fsome forces to boost protection orders.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
