OL,3,ARape and sex offence specialists on all
OL,4,Apolice forces by 2027, PM says
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham said the
OL,7,Fprevious plans were "too slow" and
OL,8,Fministers should be "laser focused" on
OL,9,Ftackling such crimes.
